{"ID":"20240314091915-8q5pec4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091915-8q5pec4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091915-8q5pec4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165305-n1wsgi8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165305-07bsm9l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:125,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165305-07bsm9l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:31,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:31\u0026#125;","title":"【柏叶汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422165305-n1wsgi8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-n1wsgi8","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吐血不止者，柏叶汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-rsr1js9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-rsr1js9","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柏叶汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-11mixu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-11mixu1","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"柏叶干姜各三两艾三把"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-y6zh8s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-y6zh8s5","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水五升，取马通汁一升，合煑取一升，分温再服。千金加阿胶三两亦佳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-23sp1uk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-23sp1uk","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家接着下来呢，大家看这个，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"吐血不止"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，从嘴巴吐血出来，里面的原因呢，可能是你食道出血，可能是你的肝癌肝硬化，因为肝癌肝硬化，这个血回不到肝..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们每个人晚上血都会落到肝里面去，可是你肝里面都是肿瘤硬化了，这个血没有办法在肝里面，结果大量的血就进入心脏，进入到你的胸腔周围，这时候，你的静脉受不了，就爆裂出来，吐血出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃里面呢出血，也会吐血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺里面出血，不是出血，是咳血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，咳嗽带的血。所以吐血呢，一定来自肠胃或者是来自内脏，不是来自肺。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-owmp77b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-owmp77b","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个柏叶汤呢，是很有名的治疗吐血的方子，这个经方跟温病呢，想法也不一样，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方认为说吐血或者下血都是肠胃里面太冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，温病...看到这个人吐这么多血出来，一定是热，开得是寒凉的药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以温病派开得都是寒凉的药，我们开得都是温热的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。完全想法是南辕北辙。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个柏叶，止血的效果非常强"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。经方里面有两个止血的，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柏叶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阿胶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个柏叶就是侧柏叶。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚脐以上有出血，我们大部分用柏叶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。肚脐以下的出血，比如女人妇科，这个月经排出来停不了，我们认为这个病人需要停的时候，本来是血无止法...我们这个血呢，无止法，如果你身体正常了，阳回头了，这个血自然而然就会停下来。那如果说，这个病人失血失得很重，病人已经贫血，这个时候我们要去止血的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下焦、阴部出来的血呢，我们会用阿胶来止血。嘴巴吐血出来的话，我们用柏叶活血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-7qnbbb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-7qnbbb9","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们后面还有一些胶艾汤，像阿胶跟艾叶...这里呢，柏叶跟艾叶配合干姜，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜是温胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，也是辛辣的，对肺非常的好，所以上焦太寒冷，我们用干姜柏叶。那艾草这个东西我们在灸的时候会用到，针灸的灸。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么用艾？艾能够进入血脉神经"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以当你用这三味药，简简单单的三味药混在一起的时候，方义就来了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"艾呢，可以让血归经，不会再到处走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柏叶呢，能够止血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜呢，能够促进肠胃的蠕动"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，让它恢复正常。因为中医的观点，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方的观点认为说里面冷才会出血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有没有道理呢？有。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-jtj6oky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-jtj6oky","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位，我请问你，如果你住在北方，台湾没有，但是如果你住在大陆的北方或者北美或者温哥华加拿大，冬天的时候，你白天去浇水，水管放在那边，那你第一次到北美来你不知道啊，下雪。你把水龙头关了，结果水管里面还有很多水，第二天早上看，水管破掉了，你还在那生气，谁把我的水管戳破，其实是冰块，冰的时候会让他暴裂掉。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人身上也是一样，太冷了血管会破裂掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以要用干姜。所以，有没有道理？你想想看，就是中医北派的观点是对的。那你如果寒热观念没有弄清楚，看到病人吐血的时候，你不敢使用热药，就耽误了治病的时机。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-fz973y7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-fz973y7","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个处方呢，最难接受的就是马通汁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个马通汁，按照过去的观念，这个马要去找白马，不是说我属马替马讲话，实在是我都不能接受，咖啡色褐色的马还不行，非得要白色的马，花的马还不行，到哪去找啊？然后呢，用白马的大便，越讲越恶心了。白马的大便跟水煮在一起，那为什么要用马通汁？有原因的，因为你如果是肠胃出血的时候，嘴巴里面吐血出来你只看到的一部分，还有一些血呢，会回流跑到小肠大肠里面去，那这个血会跟宿便混在一起，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"承气汤，我们用大黄芒硝，一般来说只能攻宿便，如果血停在肠胃里面，清不出来的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以这个用马通汁下去，就是希望能够混合在一起，能够把这个宿便排出来。因为这个马啊，诸位骑过马就知道了。你们到佛罗里达来，我带你们去骑马。这个马呢，一边走一边大便，一边可以吃东西，所以这个很厉害。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-r29mykm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-r29mykm","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个，那老师我们没有马通汁，这个方可不可以用？当然可以用啊，怎么那么蠢呢，一定要马通汁，不要那么死脑筋，好不好。所以我们治疗肝病，食道，胃，如果血从嘴巴出来，一定会用到这个处方。厉害到什么程度呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一剂就知，一副药就中了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165305-07bsm9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165305-07bsm9l","updated":"20240422165305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柏叶三钱，干姜三钱，艾叶三钱，都是三钱的量，六碗水，煮成两碗。"}]}]}